  first | exact @GlobalTheory.matrix_sqrt_near_one_ultrametric | exact GlobalTheory.matrix_sqrt_near_one_ultrametric | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.matrix_sqrt_near_one_ultrametric <;> assumption)
